01:05:15,789 --> 01:05:21,789
We Are Marshall is a 2006 American biographical
sports drama film directed by McG.

11
01:11:47,368 --> 01:11:53,368
It depicts the aftermath of the 1970 plane crash that killed 75 people: 37 players of the Marshall University Thundering Herd
football team, five coaches, two athletic trainers, the athletic director, 25 boosters, and the airplane crew of five.

12
01:18:18,947 --> 01:18:24,947
Matthew McConaughey stars as head coach Jack Lengyel, with Matthew Fox as assistant coach William "Red" Dawson, David
Strathairn as university president Donald Dedmon, and Robert Patrick as ill-fated Marshall head coach Rick Tolley.

13
